Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You paid the jeweller for gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So how much gold actually came
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,not the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The real metal you can sell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Most families never ask this question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The jeweller smiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and the bill shows the total.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone believes all of it went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,into gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But here is the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A real slice of that money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,never becomes gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes to making charges and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,GST,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,on the very first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And the day you sell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that part simply disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Many jewellers pay you only for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is gone forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and almost nobody notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So is jewellery a bad buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A wedding necklace is love,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,tradition and pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it also a smart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,way to save?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wedding season has just started after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dev Uthani.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Families across India are walking into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,jewellery shops right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This question touches almost every Indian
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,3 questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,where does your money actually go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,on the bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you really get back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,when you sell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.53,0:00:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And last,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,if gold is savings,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,is there a smarter way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Coin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,jewellery or a gold ETF?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay till the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the answer surprises most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Picture a mother in a busy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,jewellery market.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Her daughter's wedding is coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She has saved slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,over many months,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,for a single necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She picks a design she loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The jeweller weighs it and checks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,today's gold rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he starts writing the bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,line by line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The first line is the gold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Weight multiplied by today's rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only part that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,is real metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the part you own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Next comes the making charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the fee for the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,craftsman's work:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,cutting,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,shaping,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,polishing and design.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.89,0:01:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no fixed rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Some jewellers charge it per gram.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Others charge a percentage of the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,gold value.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,detailed necklace costs far more to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,make than a plain chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And notice this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The making charge buys you beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,not gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single gram of metal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,comes from that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then comes GST.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the value of the gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,GST is 3 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The GST Council fixed this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and it applies to coins and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,bars too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But the making charge has its
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,own GST.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As reported,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it is 5 percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,charged separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.73,0:02:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you pay tax on the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,craftsman's fee too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Add it all up and you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,get the final bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now ask the real question,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the one nobody asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How much of that is actually
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.01,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the first line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The gold value.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.75,0:02:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the making charge and both GST
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,not metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,On a plain chain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the cost part stays small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,On a heavy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,detailed bridal set,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it can eat a big slice
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,of your savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Necklaces of the same weight can
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,carry very different bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The gold inside is equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The craftsmanship is not,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and you pay for that difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it like a restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.61,0:02:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay for the food,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but also the chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the service and the tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the food fills your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jewellery works the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You enjoy the craftsman's work for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,at weddings and festivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that has real value.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But money-wise,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,only the gold travels with you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happens when you sell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:02:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where the real shock
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast forward a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The family needs money for a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,hospital bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,or a child's college fees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The necklace goes back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The jeweller weighs it again and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,tests the purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he checks today's gold rate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and makes an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The mother waits,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the offer is only for the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,gold inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The making charge she paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The GST on that making charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Also gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the 3 percent GST on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That does not come back either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tax paid on a purchase is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,not refunded to you when you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So the cost part of your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,bill vanished on the very first
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment you walked out of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There can be another cut too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Some jewellers deduct a small amount
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,for melting or purity loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask about this before you buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,not after.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the gold price may rise over
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,those years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That rise can cover the loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But first it must rise just
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to get you back to where
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the hidden trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your jewellery must climb a hill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,before it even reaches the starting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A plain coin starts much closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,selling has a second risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the gold is not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,as pure as the bill said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who decides the purity at the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,counter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,For years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,old family jewellery carried no proof
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,of purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The buyer tested it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and the family simply had to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.61,0:04:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,trust his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why hallmarking matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Every hallmarked piece now carries a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,unique code called HUID.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It works like an Aadhaar number
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for your jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallmarking is run by BIS,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the Bureau of Indian Standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,An approved centre tests the gold
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and stamps its purity right on
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallmarking is now mandatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and the scale is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Over 65 crore gold pieces have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,received this code.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the government's count,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,as of this October.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So before you pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,look for these marks on the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The BIS logo,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the purity grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and the HUID code.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Match the code with your bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can check the HUID yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,on the BIS Care app.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows the purity and the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,jeweller who registered that piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A hallmark protects your purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But it does not protect your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,making charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That money is still lost the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,day you sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you buy gold only
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to save,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,is there a smarter way to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,hold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is where most people get
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Picture a brother and a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Both get a bonus at work,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and both want gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants to wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He only wants to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,jewellery makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She will wear it at every
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,wedding and festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The making charge is the price
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,of beauty she enjoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But for the brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the making charge is pure leakage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Leakage means money that drips out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and never becomes an asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are his choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a gold coin or a small
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Plain metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,with very little design work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So the making cost is usually
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,much lower than on jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But a coin still pays the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,same GST on the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And at resale,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a buyer may still cut a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Smaller leak,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but still a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,a gold ETF.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.44,0:05:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,ETF means exchange traded fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a fund that buys
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,real gold and splits it into
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,small units.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You buy these units on the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,stock market,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,like a share.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a demat account,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,your online locker for shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Each unit follows the gold price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the big difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no making charge at
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And buying gold ETF units attracts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,no GST,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,as reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No locker,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,no theft worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what does an ETF cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A small yearly fee called the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,expense ratio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One large gold ETF reported a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,fee of 0.68 percent for a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,recent year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Expense ratio simply means the fund's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,yearly running fee,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,taken quietly from your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Small,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but it adds up over many
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And selling is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You sell units on the market
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,near the gold price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No weighing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,no testing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,no purity argument at the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be a small brokerage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,which is your broker's fee per
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is nothing like losing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,a whole making charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So which one wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It depends on why you buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For wearing and tradition,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For pure saving,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the leak matters a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But even smart savers make one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,common mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not about the shop
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It is about timing and tax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sell physical gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,jewellery or coins,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,at a profit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and tax applies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it at least 24 months
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to count as long term.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Long term profit on gold is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,taxed at 12.5 percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,without indexation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Indexation means raising your cost for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,rising prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you do not get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A family buys jewellery as savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they sell it in a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They lose the making charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and any profit is taxed at
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,their income slab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The real mistake is mixing beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and savings in a single purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jewellery is great for wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a costly way to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,save.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,ask the jeweller to write the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,making charge as a separate line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,on the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask for the buyback terms in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How much will the shop deduct
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,if you sell later?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A good jeweller answers clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the hallmark and the HUID
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,on the BIS Care app.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you only want to save,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,compare coins and ETFs before jewellery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Before selling physical gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,check if you have crossed 24
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules and rates can change,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so check the latest before you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.77,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It is simply your bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,explained line by line,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so you know where every rupee
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:07:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.73,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you paid for gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How much gold came home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the gold line on your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else was the price of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,who is planning the wedding jewellery
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her read every line of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the bill before paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,is gold for wearing or for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,saving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we decode another bill most of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,us never read.
